WEBVTT

00:02.540 --> 00:03.940
Sinners?

00:04.420 --> 00:05.770
We are?

00:15.470 --> 00:17.140
Lykos?

00:17.140 --> 00:19.010
They've arrived...

00:22.220 --> 00:23.350
Chakuro.

00:24.570 --> 00:25.910
Forgive me!

02:22.410 --> 02:23.610
Help!

02:23.610 --> 02:24.870
Someone!

02:24.870 --> 02:28.410
Everyone, hurry inside the buildings!

02:28.410 --> 02:30.170
Lady Taisha!

02:30.170 --> 02:33.670
Hurry! Take shelter in the Scholastic Tower!

02:45.270 --> 02:46.940
Did you hear that?

02:47.490 --> 02:49.060
Something's wrong.

02:49.060 --> 02:51.890
What's with all the ruckus out here?

02:51.890 --> 02:53.350
No clue.

02:54.230 --> 02:56.650
Check it out! What weird clothes.

02:57.060 --> 03:01.160
Think he's one of the island
girl's friends? Let's capture him.

03:01.720 --> 03:03.660
Hey, buddy.

03:03.660 --> 03:05.320
Come with us for a sec.

03:05.320 --> 03:09.190
We've got a couple questions about getting to the world outside.

03:20.800 --> 03:23.340
Buki?! Buki!

03:21.570 --> 03:22.650
What the hell?!

03:26.530 --> 03:27.370
Hey.

03:27.370 --> 03:28.180
What?!

03:28.180 --> 03:31.390
Let me out. Something's wrong up there.

03:55.330 --> 03:56.140
Ow!

03:57.810 --> 03:59.210
Sami?

04:13.580 --> 04:21.840
<i>The angels of slaughter tore our paradise to shreds with their great talons.</i>

04:28.610 --> 04:30.650
Sami, we have to run.

04:34.170 --> 04:35.580
Just for today, okay?

04:43.110 --> 04:45.800
Sami, you're not heavy at all.

04:46.940 --> 04:48.770
You're the same as three years ago.

04:49.340 --> 04:52.210
I'm sorry for teasing you yesterday.

05:00.420 --> 05:01.560
Sami...

05:18.720 --> 05:21.840
Judgement has finally fallen upon us.

05:27.170 --> 05:29.300
Sami and Chakuro are still in the fields!

05:32.710 --> 05:36.080
This is wrong... These people...

05:36.740 --> 05:39.270
aren't just sinners you can wipe out!

05:42.920 --> 05:45.440
What the hell is this?

05:47.580 --> 05:51.160
The most vital part of the
Falaina Sinner Extermination Project

05:52.400 --> 05:55.570
is keeping thorough and complete records.

05:57.470 --> 06:01.170
The end of the heretics must be chronicled for our country—

06:01.170 --> 06:06.880
no, for all of humanity to use as a guide in the future.

06:09.910 --> 06:12.090
Document with diligence.

06:20.900 --> 06:23.410
Lykos? You mustn't!

06:23.410 --> 06:24.400
Wait!

06:25.390 --> 06:27.570
<i>I have no choice but to fight.</i>

06:28.310 --> 06:32.170
<i>Even if it means betraying that person.</i>

06:38.120 --> 06:39.390
You two...

06:40.750 --> 06:42.700
Mister Suou...

06:42.700 --> 06:44.150
Are you unhurt?

06:44.150 --> 06:48.500
Yes, but there are still injured people in the fields.

06:48.500 --> 06:51.140
Mister Suou... Mister Suou!

06:52.750 --> 06:53.970
You all...

06:56.570 --> 06:57.580
Suou.

06:59.350 --> 07:01.360
Please listen to me calmly.

07:03.310 --> 07:07.190
Lady Taisha... has passed away.

07:08.360 --> 07:11.530
We've received no communication from the Council of Elders.

07:12.060 --> 07:14.640
Why is this happening?

07:16.260 --> 07:18.410
Lady Shinono!

07:20.720 --> 07:26.290
Bring everyone to the central plaza and
ask the Self-Defense Force for protection.

07:27.720 --> 07:29.890
We're dealing with other humans here.

07:30.980 --> 07:34.920
These atrocities... must not be allowed to continue!

07:36.850 --> 07:38.980
If the Council will do nothing,

07:39.570 --> 07:42.310
then I will resolve this through parley!

07:47.970 --> 07:51.240
Dammit, who do they think we are?!

07:51.240 --> 07:52.990
You won't get away with this!

07:52.530 --> 07:52.990
Don't!

08:02.750 --> 08:04.300
Aijiro!

08:04.300 --> 08:05.790
I-It's no use...

08:06.300 --> 08:10.510
They're using their thymia to kill people!

08:10.510 --> 08:12.840
They're demons! This can't be real!

08:14.550 --> 08:16.910
G-Get the hell back!

08:16.910 --> 08:19.600
Stay away from us!

08:20.200 --> 08:20.920
Nibi.

08:22.450 --> 08:23.980
Ouni!

08:23.980 --> 08:27.800
Ouni! Buki and Aijiro are dead!

08:27.800 --> 08:29.880
They were killed!

08:33.960 --> 08:35.950
Is this what it's like?

08:37.630 --> 08:42.010
In the land beyond the sand ocean that we've always yearned for,

08:43.170 --> 08:48.350
a gang of masked thugs can crush our dreams in a second.

08:49.470 --> 08:51.530
That's the kind of world it is?

08:55.260 --> 08:56.890
Ouni!

09:01.210 --> 09:02.420
I've had enough.

09:03.280 --> 09:05.310
That's it...

09:06.440 --> 09:10.270
I've had enough of this world!

09:14.350 --> 09:16.280
Is this everyone?

09:16.280 --> 09:17.350
Suou, sir!

09:18.670 --> 09:20.450
Ginshu of the Self-Defense Force here!

09:20.870 --> 09:25.210
It is our mission to protect the peace of the Mud Whale.

09:25.210 --> 09:28.300
There is nothing for it but to repay them tit-for-tat!

09:28.300 --> 09:30.370
One mustn't kill one's enemies.

09:31.550 --> 09:35.040
There will be no end to it if you meet violence with violence.

09:37.310 --> 09:40.220
There is no reason for us to be attacked.

09:41.410 --> 09:44.420
There must be a misunderstanding underlying this situation.

09:44.420 --> 09:46.140
We are going to resolve it.

09:48.150 --> 09:51.690
<i>Lady Taisha surely would have done the same.</i>

10:41.550 --> 10:42.870
<i>Lady Taisha...</i>

10:44.140 --> 10:46.410
<i>is this for the best?</i>

10:48.430 --> 10:49.850
<i>Is this...</i>

10:51.060 --> 10:52.450
<i>our only option?</i>

11:01.730 --> 11:03.370
<i>I don't want to see anything.</i>

11:05.180 --> 11:08.070
<i>Sami, I've done enough, right?</i>

11:10.460 --> 11:13.000
<i>I'll keep my eyes closed with you, okay?</i>

11:15.110 --> 11:19.790
<i>Then I won't have to see any more bad things.</i>

11:21.280 --> 11:22.700
Chakuro!

11:23.020 --> 11:24.200
Chakuro!

11:24.520 --> 11:25.910
Where's our brother?

11:26.220 --> 11:27.420
You guys...

11:30.030 --> 11:30.620
Wait!

11:31.770 --> 11:32.630
Stop it!

11:34.220 --> 11:37.050
Don't do anything to them! I'm beg—

11:48.270 --> 11:51.730
N-No!

11:55.170 --> 11:56.480
Stop...

12:00.530 --> 12:02.150
Just stop!

12:24.730 --> 12:26.720
<i>He has the same skin color as Lykos.</i>

12:27.260 --> 12:28.980
Big bro!

12:28.980 --> 12:30.650
What were you thinking?

12:32.440 --> 12:33.190
Chakuro!

12:33.550 --> 12:35.060
Chakuro, run!

12:36.890 --> 12:39.940
Don't touch Sami! Stay away from her!

12:51.660 --> 12:53.040
Halt.

12:53.510 --> 12:54.690
Not her.

12:58.310 --> 13:00.000
We were unaware you were alive.

13:00.500 --> 13:07.850
We received a report that the nous Lykos was wiped out by an attack while en route to exterminate Falaina.

13:08.280 --> 13:10.090
Are there other survivors?

13:10.090 --> 13:12.810
Hey, what the hell's going on?

13:14.090 --> 13:17.340
This way, please. We will return you to Skylos.

13:17.340 --> 13:18.150
Let go.

13:19.230 --> 13:21.530
I won't be going back with you.

13:21.530 --> 13:25.530
I see you have lost your mental faculties without the restraint of the nous.

13:26.960 --> 13:32.750
A sad state of affairs for the younger sister of the commander in charge of the extermination.

13:32.750 --> 13:34.370
My brother has nothing to do with it!

13:34.370 --> 13:37.460
Has he been looking for me?

13:37.460 --> 13:42.050
Did he report my possible death to our parents?

13:42.470 --> 13:46.880
Even if I returned to our country, I would be no more than a heartless, nameless puppet!

13:47.390 --> 13:48.660
Please wait.

13:49.580 --> 13:52.600
Relay a message to Skylos' Commander Araphne.

14:05.460 --> 14:07.150
Lykos...

14:07.720 --> 14:11.080
Who... Who are you?

14:11.940 --> 14:13.190
Answer me.

14:15.010 --> 14:18.300
He looks like he has the same skin color as you.

14:18.300 --> 14:20.040
Hey, hey, hey!

14:20.320 --> 14:22.500
Don't get your ass beat, maggot!

14:25.530 --> 14:27.340
Lykos No. 32!

14:28.090 --> 14:29.970
You're alive!

14:29.970 --> 14:30.800
Liontari.

14:31.330 --> 14:34.090
You were onboard Skylos?

14:34.090 --> 14:37.430
I was worried when I heard Lykos was obliterated!

14:38.010 --> 14:40.560
You lack the heart to feel that.

14:41.000 --> 14:45.190
You got me! Like I had the time to waste worrying!

14:45.190 --> 14:48.830
I was deployed to take part in the genocide!

14:48.830 --> 14:53.870
I was so, so excited, I couldn't think of anything else!

14:54.120 --> 14:57.360
Falaina is the greatest paradise ever!

14:57.890 --> 15:00.580
It's just infested with defenseless prey!

15:04.450 --> 15:05.500
Just look.

15:06.870 --> 15:11.840
I'm allowed to butcher cute girls like her all I want here.

15:13.140 --> 15:15.180
Don't touch Sami!

15:24.760 --> 15:26.480
He's crying...

15:26.480 --> 15:28.830
This guy's crying!

15:28.830 --> 15:32.450
I hardly ever see people who cry.

15:33.000 --> 15:35.450
I want to see more tears.

15:35.910 --> 15:37.710
I want to destroy him.

15:38.900 --> 15:40.590
I want to kill him!

15:41.370 --> 15:44.590
Liontari, I won't let you harm him!

15:45.330 --> 15:49.030
No. 32, why are you getting in my way?

15:51.440 --> 15:53.900
Does that mean I can kill you too?

16:03.620 --> 16:05.190
Skylos.

16:06.080 --> 16:08.320
We have secured the nous Lykos.

16:09.670 --> 16:11.370
Withdraw the troops.

16:21.290 --> 16:22.380
Chakuro!

16:32.090 --> 16:34.590
Lion, that's all for today.

16:34.590 --> 16:35.990
Let's go.

16:35.990 --> 16:40.220
Hey, what about her? Aren't we taking her with us?

16:40.550 --> 16:43.220
No, I'm not going back!

16:43.940 --> 16:46.540
As if you'd be allowed not to.

16:46.540 --> 16:49.570
Besides, what would you even do on Falaina?

16:49.880 --> 16:53.780
Every single person here is going to die.

16:53.780 --> 16:55.280
Unhand me!

16:56.730 --> 16:58.140
Why, you...

16:59.450 --> 17:04.280
Hey, dumb and dumber! I've got a message!

17:04.280 --> 17:06.170
It's Commander-in-Chief Orka's jester.

17:06.590 --> 17:09.980
No. 32 will be left on Falaina.

17:09.980 --> 17:16.640
The Commander is making his sister into a human sample to test the effects of Falaina on the body.

17:17.080 --> 17:24.120
From now on she is to be referred to as Skylos Sample No. 4, ya hear?

17:24.730 --> 17:29.820
That's awful! And here the sister he thought was dead turned up alive...

17:29.820 --> 17:31.730
Hey, Sample No. 4!

17:32.110 --> 17:35.610
You've been abandoned by your brother!

17:38.070 --> 17:41.240
I'm outta here. Hey, gimme a lift!

17:49.480 --> 17:52.230
I'll be back, Sample No. 4!

17:52.230 --> 17:57.930
I can't wait to see how crazy Falaina makes you by the time I return!

18:07.800 --> 18:09.570
<i>Sure you have a name.</i>

18:10.100 --> 18:13.780
<i>I saw "Lykos" embroidered into your clothes.</i>

18:21.520 --> 18:22.990
Commander Orka.

18:23.410 --> 18:26.190
Do you recall who I am?

18:26.190 --> 18:29.050
I am a friend of your younger sister.

18:31.880 --> 18:37.430
Don't you think it's a bit cruel to use your sister as a guinea pig?

18:38.460 --> 18:44.850
I hear you'll be appointed governor of
some province if this mission succeeds.

18:45.260 --> 18:51.290
So basically, aren't you sacrificing
your sister just to climb the ladder?

18:54.350 --> 18:58.070
I am not after political power.

18:59.260 --> 19:01.790
My objective lies elsewhere.

19:09.300 --> 19:10.750
Lady Taisha...

19:16.970 --> 19:17.970
Ouni!

19:21.390 --> 19:24.900
H-Hey, what happened to your clothes?

19:24.900 --> 19:26.010
I need medicine.

19:26.010 --> 19:28.760
That blood... Are you hurt?

19:28.760 --> 19:30.650
The medicine is for my friends.

19:33.890 --> 19:34.730
In seven days...

19:36.440 --> 19:38.570
they'll be coming back.

19:39.420 --> 19:43.530
Their goal this time was only to collect the ship we found the girl on.

19:44.190 --> 19:46.970
It seems a true attack on the Mud Whale is next.

19:46.970 --> 19:49.670
H-How do you even know that?

19:49.670 --> 19:51.250
I forced them to tell me.

19:51.670 --> 19:53.530
F-Forced?

19:53.530 --> 19:56.750
I kept two alive, and then killed them after.

19:57.060 --> 19:58.250
You...

19:58.790 --> 20:02.430
They were both the same age as us.

20:04.550 --> 20:06.400
Why did you hit him?!

20:06.400 --> 20:09.680
Torture is unforgivable!

20:10.180 --> 20:13.560
He did it for our sakes! Ouni didn't do anything wrong!

20:13.940 --> 20:17.520
If Ouni hadn't done it, we'd all be dead in a few days!

20:18.580 --> 20:22.470
Ouni's doing all the dirty work for us!

20:22.470 --> 20:23.490
That's enough.

20:23.820 --> 20:25.540
Let's go, Kicha.

20:25.540 --> 20:28.450
H-Hold on, wait! Don't just leave!

20:29.890 --> 20:32.960
Bring captives to the SDF—no, straight to me!

20:34.350 --> 20:36.740
I don't trust anyone but my friends.

20:39.960 --> 20:43.810
<i>The funerals were held the following day.</i>

20:48.710 --> 20:55.060
<i>Crying was forbidden at funerals, but not
a single one of us could restrain ourselves.</i>

20:56.960 --> 21:01.640
I had always wanted to extend the lives of the Marked...

21:03.310 --> 21:12.800
But that was because I knew I wouldn't be able to bear losing Sami or anyone else while I still lived.

21:16.990 --> 21:18.630
I have no words.

21:18.630 --> 21:20.120
I'm sorry.

21:21.090 --> 21:23.550
I couldn't protect Sami...

21:38.150 --> 21:44.230
<i>It was a cloudless day, and the lights of the sand burials were unforgettably beautiful.</i>

21:50.950 --> 21:54.890
<i>If this world has to be full of such sorrow,</i>

21:56.500 --> 21:59.500
<i>and this view was the last thing I ever saw,</i>

22:00.740 --> 22:05.530
<i>I wouldn't mind dying right then and there.</i>
